(7693154, 1261193, 4008, '<td valign="top">The bird seems to be on the edge of sharpness. Sharpness looks to be mainly behind the bird. The scene could do with some cropping to remove some distracting branches.</td>', 'The bird seems to be on the edge of sharpness. Sharpness looks to be mainly behind the bird. The scene could do with some cropping to remove some distracting branches.', '2021-05-01 14:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
