(7693156, 1261051, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice flower and backlight plus sun shining through. Was this shot through a dirty filter or dirty glass? That does not make it better. Also I would clone or crop away the red in the top left.</td>', 'Nice flower and backlight plus sun shining through. Was this shot through a dirty filter or dirty glass? That does not make it better. Also I would clone or crop away the red in the top left.', '2021-05-01 15:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
