(7693266, 1260524, 4008, '<td valign="top">The looks are indeed similar. I really like the light, the shadows and how both eyes are visible. The arm and hand add an extra element of interest and diagonal, but the hand seems to be floating, it does not support the head. Probably if it was held a bit closer to the face and the thumb would not be visible, it would feel more natural.</td>', 'The looks are indeed similar. I really like the light, the shadows and how both eyes are visible. The arm and hand add an extra element of interest and diagonal, but the hand seems to be floating, it does not support the head. Probably if it was held a bit closer to the face and the thumb would not be visible, it would feel more natural.', '2021-05-03 06:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
